<title>UK: TABLE-Vendome year sterling profit falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Vendome year sterling profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Unit (pence)	     26.5		   vs 27.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.78		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.40		  vs N/A</p>
<p> Pre-tax		    247.5		  vs 257.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,455.7		vs 1,466.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Vendome said it raised its total dividend by 1.6 percent in sterling terms versus the previous year.</p>
<p>In Swiss francs, turnover rose 11.7 percent to 998.8 million, pretax profit grew 8.1 percent to 509.9 million, and earnings per unit increased 7.8 percent to 0.546.</p>
<p>Final dividend was 0.200 Swiss francs per unit, making a total for the year of 0.295, an increase of 22.9 percent.</p>
<p>Full company name - Vendome Luxury Group Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
